### Search flights and return offers from the configured provider
POST {{baseUrl}}/flights/searches
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "routes": [
    {
      "origin": "MOW",
      "destination": "LED",
      "departureDate": "2026-10-23"
    }
  ],
  "passengers": [
    {
      "type": "adult",
      "count": 1
    }
  ],
  "cabinClass": "economy",
  "directOnly": false,
  "baggageRequired": true,
  "preferredAirlines": []
}

> {% client.global.set("flightOfferId", response.body.data[0].id); %}

### Get offer
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/offers/{{flightOfferId}}
Accept: application/json

### Revalidate offer
POST {{baseUrl}}/flights/offers/{{flightOfferId}}/revalidate
Accept: application/json

### Get fare rules
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/offers/{{flightOfferId}}/fare-rules
Accept: application/json
